# Requests of the extra of lab 4.2 (REV-12), in the order of "Check it" in the lab booklet.
# Start first: your review-service.
@reviewUrl = http://localhost:8083

### Writing without login
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"stars": 4, "text": "Great evening."}

### Wrong password
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Authorization: Basic alice@example.com Alice
Content-Type: application/json

{"stars": 4, "text": "Great evening."}

### An organizer writes a review
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Authorization: Basic olivia@example.com olivia
Content-Type: application/json

{"stars": 5, "text": "My own event, of course."}

### Changing without login
PUT {{reviewUrl}}/api/reviews/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"stars": 1, "text": "Terrible."}
